1
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,439
Tell me, are the two of you...

2
00:00:54,039 --> 00:00:54,520
I—

3
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,560
The two of us...

4
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,479
are just pure revolutionary comrades!

5
00:00:58,840 --> 00:00:59,479
Dad,

6
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,200
how much did you drink?

7
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,200
My son!

8
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,040
Dawei!

9
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,719
This is your son?

10
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,439
Brother Dawei!

11
00:01:09,239 --> 00:01:10,560
You're finally back!

12
00:01:11,519 --> 00:01:12,280
Big Brother,

13
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,359
what are you doing at my place?

14
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,680
Why call him brother? Call him Uncle!

15
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:18,760
Uncle...

16
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,920
Don't listen to your dad.

17
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,439
Call me brother. It sounds younger!

18
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:22,920
Sit, sit, sit!

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,040
Back in our day,

20
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,599
when we were chasing girls,

21
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,799
we were so bold and fearless!

22
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,239
Now look at these kids...

23
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:32,560
Let me tell you,

24
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,280
look at him,

25
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,599
look how old he is!

26
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:37,000
He doesn't even have a wife yet!

27
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,840
A girl even dumped him recently.

28
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,760
Isn't that just embarrassing

29
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,040
for our Ma family?

30
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:41,959
Dad,

31
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:42,760
you've had too much to drink.

32
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,799
Why are you airing my dirty laundry?

33
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:44,959
I'm just telling the truth!

34
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,280
Still single, huh?

35
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,280
Yeah, not yet.

36
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:47,879
Got dumped?

37
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:48,920
Yeah, got dumped.

38
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:49,840
Good riddance!

39
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:50,799
That's great!

40
00:01:50,799 --> 00:01:51,319
Wonderful!

41
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,079
Brother Dawei,

42
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:54,920
your big bro here

43
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,200
has a niece,

44
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,760
around your age.

45
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,040
This niece of mine...

46
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,159
You want capability?

47
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,000
She's got capability.

48
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,480
You want looks? She's got looks!

49
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:08,759
She runs a conglomerate worth hundreds of billions!

50
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:13,560
Just one thing.

51
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,639
Lately, she...

52
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:17,879
got herself a gigolo living off her.

53
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,520
It drives me crazy!

54
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,759
These gigolos who swindle rich women...

55
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,560
They're the absolute worst!

56
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,080
We have to deal with him harshly!

57
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:26,800
Teach him a real lesson!

58
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,240
You think so too, right?

59
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,120
Brother,

60
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,479
look at our Dawei.

61
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,879
Handsome,

62
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,240
and sharp as a tack.

63
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,439
He's alright.

64
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,639
Dawei,

65
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,479
you squeeze that gigolo...

66
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,599
Get him...

67
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,680
out of the way.

68
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,719
Push him out!

69
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:46,599
When the time comes,

70
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,360
I'll call the shots.

71
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:49,520
From then on,

72
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,280
the money...

73
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,240
will be yours.

74
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,479
The woman...

75
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,039
will be yours, too.

76
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:55,759
Brother Ma,

77
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,120
we've got to keep the wealth in the family.

78
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:57,919
Uncle, uncle, uncle...

79
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,280
Right, Brother Ma?

80
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,000
You've had too much to drink.

81
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:02,080
I never play the fall guy.

82
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,719
Your older niece

83
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,159
who keeps a gigolo on the side...

84
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,319
I really can't handle someone like that.

85
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,919
You'd better find someone else.

86
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,879
Brother, brother, brother...

87
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,039
Hear me out for a second.

88
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,879
Our Dawei here...

89
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:19,879
is at least a decent,

90
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,599
pure young bachelor.

91
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,439
So what you're doing...

92
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,719
Come on, let's drink, drink, drink.

93
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,479
Brother Ma, come on.

94
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:29,759
You shot her down without even meeting her!

95
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,719
Dawei, just think it over.

96
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,000
Uncle, Uncle, look.

97
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,759
Let me propose a toast.

98
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,199
Here's to you

99
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,639
soon getting rid of

100
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:40,360
that gigolo conning your niece,

101
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:41,919
and taking him out for good.

102
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,080
Great!

103
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,840
From your lips to God's ears!

104
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,599
I'll definitely tear that deadbeat gigolo

105
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,800
limb from limb!

106
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:51,719
Here!

107
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,479
Teach him a real lesson!

108
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:53,759
Come on, cheers!

109
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,919
Uncle, watch your step.

110
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,319
Slow down, take it easy.

111
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,560
Dawei...

112
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,520
I had a great time today.

113
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,840
Dawei...

114
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,439
Earlier at dinner,

115
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:11,439
when I told you about my niece...

116
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:13,479
You want looks?

117
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,360
She's got looks.

118
00:04:15,479 --> 00:04:16,600
You want capability?

119
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,399
She's got capability.

120
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:20,959
Why... why...

121
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,120
don't you believe me, huh?

122
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,959
I believe you, I do.

123
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,360
I'll take you to see her tonight!

124
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:24,959
Let's go!

125
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,040
Next time, next time.

126
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,000
Next time, Uncle.

127
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:27,639
We're going tonight!

128
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,959
Where do you live, Uncle?

129
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,879
Let's go, let's go!

130
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,160
I really need to move.

131
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:36,279
Not her again.

132
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,839
Ma Dawei.

133
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,959
I thought after you came into money,

134
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:42,279
you'd at least mingle with high society.

135
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,319
And yet?

136
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:46,160
Now you're even scamming

137
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,120
drunk old men out of their money?

138
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,399
Which eye saw me scamming anyone?

139
00:04:50,959 --> 00:04:51,720
No, no.

140
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,879
It's fine, it's fine.

141
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,480
Listen here, young lady.

142
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:58,800
Don't walk around with your nose in the air,

143
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,439
or you'll trip right into a ditch.

144
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,279
Exactly.

145
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:02,240
Mister,

146
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,120
I was just giving you a friendly warning.

147
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,639
If you want to throw my kindness back in my face,

148
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,680
then forget I said anything.

149
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,319
But even when people get old,

150
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,759
they should still keep better company.

151
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,560
Hanging around someone like him all day

152
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,360
only degrades you in your old age.

153
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,079
Right.

154
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,319
You're the expert on social climbing, Manager Zhou.

155
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,959
You climbed all the way into rich old men's beds.

156
00:05:22,439 --> 00:05:23,079
Ma Dawei!

157
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,120
Dawei...

158
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:27,360
is this the woman your dad mentioned,

159
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,839
the one who dumped you?

160
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,120
Good riddance!

161
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:33,680
A woman like that

162
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,279
would've ruined you sooner or later.

163
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,439
True that.

164
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:37,680
Ma Dawei,

165
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,639
you think you're so clean?

166
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,079
You're just living off a sugar mommy!

167
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,079
Chairman Zhao

168
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,360
is having dinner tonight

169
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:49,240
with the real big boss behind Yunding Group.

170
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,120
That man

171
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,240
just returned from overseas,

172
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,959
a titan worth hundreds of billions!

173
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,279
As Zhao Gang's woman,

174
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,720
that backer of yours

175
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,000
won't be able to protect you for long!

176
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,639
Get back here and explain yourself!

177
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,519
What backer?

178
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,560
How come I don't even know about it?

179
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,279
All you ever do is spread rumors!

180
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,079
Uncle,

181
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:12,959
I'm sorry about that.

182
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,199
Sorry you had to see that.

183
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,800
That woman has a screw loose.

184
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,480
Don't take it to heart.

185
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,040
Oh, but I'm definitely

186
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,240
taking it to heart.

187
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:24,040
All right.

188
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,720
You can drop me off here.

189
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:26,959
Go on ahead.

190
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,319
All right.

191
00:06:28,519 --> 00:06:30,000
I'll head back and see how wasted my dad is.

192
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,120
Uncle, get home safe!

193
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,279
Second Master.

194
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,480
Zhao Gang asked to meet with you tonight.

195
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:35,800
Are we still going?

196
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,319
Not anymore.

197
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:40,000
Why would I ever cross

198
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:42,199
our little God of Wealth over Zhao Gang?

199
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,879
Look into Zhao Gang.

200
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,040
Yes, sir.

201
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,680
It's way past mealtime.

202
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,839
Why isn't Second Master here yet?

203
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,120
Did someone go pick him up?

204
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,360
Yes, sir.

205
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,720
A man of Second Master's stature...

206
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,680
It's only normal for him to be a bit late.

207
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:09,560
C-Chairman Zhao...

208
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:10,680
Where is he?

209
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,000
Second Master...

210
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,480
H-He's not coming.

211
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,560
Today,

212
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,959
when I went to pick Second Master up,

213
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,120
he had just gotten back.

214
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,519
He...

215
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,079
He said...

216
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:22,839
What did he say?

217
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,240
Give me his exact words!

218
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,560
Miss a single word,

219
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,800
and I'll kill you!

220
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:31,040
S-Second Master said

221
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,920
the people around Zhao Gang

222
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,600
are all blind, petty fools.

223
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,199
They ruined my mood today for no reason,

224
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,720
so I-I'm skipping this dinner.

225
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,720
Did you blind idiot

226
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,040
say something you shouldn't have?

227
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,240
Me?

228
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,600
Last time with Shen Jialing,

229
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,040
you two were the ones who screwed up!

230
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,959
C-Chairman Zhao...

231
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:53,000
I-I swear!

232
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,839
I waited in the hotel lobby all day!

233
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:56,560
I definitely didn't offend anyone!

234
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,199
That's you!

235
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,160
I haven't even stepped out of the house today!

236
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:06,240
I don't even know what Second Master looks like!

237
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,959
How could I have offended him?

238
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:10,240
It'd better not be you two.

239
00:08:12,199 --> 00:08:13,519
Right now, Second Master Xu

240
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,439
is Zhao's Construction's only lifeline!

241
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,040
Whoever, at this critical moment,

242
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:19,959
upsets my God of Wealth,

243
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:22,319
I'll chop them to pieces and dump them in the river!

244
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,160
Go find out who provoked him right now!

245
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,480
Yes, sir!

246
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,519
Who on earth could be so blind?

247
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,320
Chairman Shen, something's wrong!

248
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,039
Speak.

249
00:08:44,759 --> 00:08:46,559
Just two hours into trading this morning,

250
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:47,840
someone started aggressively buying up shares,

251
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:50,360
snapping up massive amounts of Yunding's retail floating shares!

252
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:51,840
They have massive capital,

253
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,639
and their tactics are extremely brutal.

254
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:55,519
It's a complete dump and scoop, regardless of cost.

255
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,440
In just a few days,

256
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:56,960
they've accumulated enough shares

257
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,440
to approach the 5% disclosure threshold!

258
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,480
This is an outright

259
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,879
hostile takeover targeting Yunding!

260
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,759
Who has that kind of cash flow

261
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:04,279
to move Yunding's stock?

262
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:07,399
Is it those veteran coastal capital firms,

263
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,799
or foreign institutions?

264
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,679
Did you find out who's pulling the strings?

265
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,879
It's not an institution.

266
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,960
It's an individual hot-money account.

267
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:14,600
Who?

268
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:15,639
Ma Dawei.

269
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,200
Who?

270
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,440
Say that again.

271
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,360
Ma Dawei.

272
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,720
I verified it repeatedly. It's him.

273
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,840
Is he out of his mind?

274
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,320
How could he possibly acquire Yunding?

275
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,519
Where did he get the money?

276
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,240
Call him right now.

277
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,519
I want to see what he's playing at!

278
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:43,799
Meet in person?

279
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,320
Special Assistant Lin,

280
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:48,159
Chairwoman Shen sure is well-informed.

281
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,519
What?

282
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:52,519
Seeing I've almost scooped up Yunding's floating shares,

283
00:09:52,679 --> 00:09:53,440
she can't sit still anymore?

284
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:54,519
A meeting?

285
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,200
Sure.

286
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:57,120
Have Chairwoman Shen bring the financial statements

287
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,600
and get in line at my rundown factory.

288
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,679
Expecting me to go to Yunding to see her?

289
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,039
Am I an idiot?

